Node ID=20 The Wish Explained
Text=It all started with a Saracen claiming to possess a magic that could prevent the Necromancers from claiming the Bleeding Lance. At first, even though the situation was desperate, Jehanne was loath to use desert magic.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=
Go to node ID=21 The Wish Continued
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=21 The Wish Continued
Text=But as the undead creatures burst into the final sanctum, Jehanne ordered the Saracen to cast his magic. The Knight of Saladin invoked the power of his brass lamp, asking the power inside for aid.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=
Go to node ID=22 The Wish Continued
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=22 The Wish Continued
Text='Help us keep this relic safe for all time', the Saracen begged the lamp, and with that fateful wish the creature appeared. Not a benevolent djinn of children's fable, but a desert demon of brimstone and sulfur, a malicious efreet.
