Node ID=23 The Wish Ending
Text=In an instant, everything changed... for the worse. We were torn from the mind of our Pious Child as she, and the knights that served her, were cursed into undeath, condemned to keep the relic safe for all time... as the Saracen  wished. They are doomed to fight the Necromancers' undead legion for all eternity.
Should Have Voiceover=0

